data_pdte2
# Phase identity: layered 1T CdI2-type PdTe2, P-3m1, Z=1.
# Provenance: Pell, Mironov, and Ibers, Acta Cryst. C52, 1331--1332
# (1996), doi:10.1107/S0108270195016246; COD 2004955 (CC0):
# https://www.crystallography.net/cod/2004955.cif
# The source 1a Pd and 2d Te sites are expanded explicitly in P1. Layers
# stack along c; primitive P-3m1 permits a finite basal (001) reflection.
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a shared modeling placeholder, not the
# displacement parameter refined by the source.
# Limiting checks: V=sqrt(3)a^2c/2, 1Pd+2Te, finite (001) coupling.
# Validation: pdte2-p3m1-structure
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M 'P 1'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number 1
_cell_length_a 4.024
_cell_length_b 4.024
_cell_length_c 5.113
_cell_angle_alpha 90.0
_cell_angle_beta 90.0
_cell_angle_gamma 120.0
